# Where `clo f` (fast mode) launches for each Claude account. Copy to
#     ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/agents-shared/clo-fast-folders
# and keep it there, untracked.
#
# One line per account: the account name from the claude-accounts file (clo -a NAME), then a
# folder (~ allowed). An account with no line launches in $DEV_ROOT/notebook; with neither,
# clo f asks which folder.
#
# Optional extra columns: folders under which this account is the one `clo f`, `clo 1-4` and
# `clo here` use when you give no -a (the longest matching folder wins; elsewhere the default
# account is used). -a NAME always wins.
#
# account   fast-mode folder       use this account under
work        ~/dev/work/notebook    ~/dev/work
personal    ~/dev/personal/notebook  ~/dev/personal
